## how to read this

**0.391 is indistinguishable from v14 (0.379).** Twenty frames, seven new negative constructions and the guideline-grounded scope rules bought nothing measurable. That is a real finding for the write-up: construction coverage is not the binding constraint either.

The composition-matched arms on v15 all landed within 0.02 of each other, so if this number disappoints, composition is not the explanation and does not need testing again.

